{"id":"verlobung","lemma":"Verlobung","pos":"noun","rank":4150,"glosses":["engagement, betrothal (a promise to wed)"],"ipa":"/ˌfɛɐ̯ˈloːbʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/30/De-Verlobung.ogg/De-Verlobung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Verlobung","plural":"Verlobungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Seine Eltern sind mit der Verlobung einverstanden.","en":"His parents approve of the engagement.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"parents"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"in agreement, agreeing"}]},{"text":"Sie gaben die Verlobung ihrer Tochter bekannt.","en":"They announced the engagement of their daughter.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"she","l":"sie"},{"g":"daughter"},{"g":"known, familiar"}]},{"text":"Ich habe unsere Verlobung aufgelöst.","en":"I've broken off our engagement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"dissolved, drained"}]},{"text":"Sie haben ihre Verlobung bekanntgegeben.","en":"They've announced their engagement.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"announced"}]},{"text":"Lass mich dir zu deiner Verlobung gratulieren.","en":"Let me congratulate you on your engagement.","words":[{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"yours, thine"},null,{"g":"to congratulate"}]}]}